# width: 120
# height: 40
# A leaf's tab strip re-fits its window when the strip narrows, so the
# active tab stays on it. With a pinned tab first and a split halving
# the strip, the window fitted for the full width used to stay put: the
# left half showed only the pin and `‹ 1/4 ›`, the tab the pane was
# showing nowhere on its strip.
write README.md "# r\n"
write src/app.ts "x\n"
write src/main.zig "fn main() void {}\n"
write package.json "{}\n"
open README.md
open src/app.ts
open src/main.zig
open package.json
command buffer.pin_toggle
open src/app.ts
command view.split_right
command view.focus_left
expect pane "app.ts"
# The left strip's window is the active tab's page, not the pin's.
expect screen lacks "‹ 1/4 ›"
expect screen contains "app.ts"
expect screen contains "󰐕   ‹ 3/4 ›"
